# Matrix file for tlc-matrix.sh. Copy it beside your spec as <Name>.matrix and
# edit. Paths are relative to this file. A `spec` line resets the `check`
# lines; each `run` is one TLC run with the CONSTANTS after the bar. Each spec
# must name its top-level formula Spec. mutate.py reads the checks and runs of
# <Name>.matrix for the mutations in <Name>.mutations.

spec BoundedQueue.tla
check INVARIANTS TypeOK InWindow
check PROPERTIES AllConsumed
# The shipped window, the boundary below it, and an empty input.
run window=1 items=3 | Window=1 Items=3
run window=4 items=5 | Window=4 Items=5
run window=4 items=0 | Window=4 Items=0

# Further specs follow the same shape. A set-valued constant has no spaces;
# model values are bare names.
#   spec HandOver.tla
#   check INVARIANTS TypeOK NoDoubleFree NoLeak
#   run workers=3 failat=all | Workers={w1,w2,w3} FailAt={1,2,3}
